insert=r'''<div class="arc17-hero"><img id="arc17Scene" src="assets/arc_awaken.webp" alt="Current Arc cinematic environment"><div class="arc17-copy"><div class="arc17-kicker">MUTATION 17 // ARC INTELLIGENCE ENGINE</div><div class="arc17-title" id="arc17Title">THE ARC IS WATCHING</div><div class="arc17-sub" id="arc17Sub">The system reads your recent execution, capability practice, evidence and recovery pattern, then turns that history into a current recommendation.</div><div class="arc17-chips"><span class="arc17-chip" id="arc17ChapterChip">AWAKENING</span><span class="arc17-chip" id="arc17DayChip">DAY 01</span><span class="arc17-chip" id="arc17ModeChip">CALIBRATING</span></div></div></div><div class="intel-kpis"><div class="intel-kpi"><span>ARC SIGNAL</span><b id="arc17Signal">00</b></div><div class="intel-kpi"><span>BASELINE</span><b id="arc17Baseline">LOW</b></div><div class="intel-kpi"><span>PRESSURE</span><b id="arc17Pressure">00</b></div><div class="intel-kpi"><span>READINESS</span><b id="arc17Readiness">00%</b></div></div><div class="arc17-grid"><div class="arc17-panel"><h4>ADAPTIVE DIRECTIVE</h4><p>The system chooses the next useful pressure from the pattern your last days created.</p><div class="intel-directive"><div class="id-label" id="arc17DirectiveType">CURRENT RECOMMENDATION</div><strong id="arc17Directive">Begin the Arc.</strong><small id="arc17DirectiveDesc">Your first job is to establish a reliable baseline.</small><div class="intel-actions"><button class="control-btn primary" onclick="acceptArcDirective17()">ACCEPT INTO QUESTS</button><button class="control-btn" onclick="refreshArcIntel17()">RECALCULATE</button></div></div><div class="signal-list" id="arc17Signals"></div></div><div class="arc17-panel"><h4>ARC MEMORY</h4><p>Important transitions are preserved as a timeline instead of disappearing into a progress bar.</p><div class="timeline17" id="arc17Timeline"></div></div></div><div class="arc17-panel" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:4px"><div><div class="section-title" style="font-size:11px">CHAPTER RAIL</div><div class="section-sub">The world changes because the Arc changes.</div></div><span class="small">7 CHAPTERS</span></div><div class="chapter-rail" id="chapterRail17"></div></div><div class="arc17-panel" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:4px"><div><div class="section-title" style="font-size:11px">CINEMATIC MILESTONES</div><div class="section-sub">Major moments become rooms you can enter.</div></div><span class="small">DAY 01 → DAY 90</span></div><div class="milestone-grid17" id="milestoneGrid17"></div></div><div class="reflection17"><div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:4px"><div><div class="section-title" style="font-size:11px">REFLECTION GATE</div><div class="section-sub" id="reflection17Sub">Write the lesson of the current chapter before moving deeper.</div></div></div><textarea id="reflection17Text" maxlength="600" placeholder="What did this chapter teach you about how you actually work?"></textarea><div class="intel-actions"><button class="control-btn primary" onclick="sealReflection17()">SEAL CHAPTER REFLECTION</button><span class="small" id="reflection17Status">No reflection sealed.</span></div></div>'''
